<title>USA: Neurogen obesity drug OK in Phase IA trial.</title>
<headline>Neurogen obesity drug OK in Phase IA trial.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neurogen Corp said Wednesday that Phase IA trial results were positive for NGD 95-1, its drug for treating eating disorders such as obesity and binging.</p>
<p>The company said NGD 95-1 proved safe and well-tolerated at all dose levels tested. It said it now has treated more than 80 people with NGD 95-1 in its clinical safety program.</p>
</text>
